    "$t": "Sann-kap讀小說 - 人生70 tsiah開始"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">《</span><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">人生70 tsiah開始</span><span style=\"font-size: x-large; text-align: center;\">》</span><span style=\"font-size: large; text-align: center;\">/</span><span style=\"text-align: left;\">澎錦</span><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhuY2-3g-r6q4x-_s9b-bdLYBaNFoRHvhP1BVVLo7boaZKAgP1J0xi6sO5hHJnbAbzME0bRbiJA8W0Q2AhoWg5Fhrk1ZAa41WWOzyHwSvqoHzvCiz3hQZE4vLnN95xIknivwxH-AHuSoEkDjkMbvk0T-8IP-GMPmiI2e2VCMIDVQktL9S-fhs_-UB61kw_N\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"\" data-original-height=\"1518\" data-original-width=\"1075\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhuY2-3g-r6q4x-_s9b-bdLYBaNFoRHvhP1BVVLo7boaZKAgP1J0xi6sO5hHJnbAbzME0bRbiJA8W0Q2AhoWg5Fhrk1ZAa41WWOzyHwSvqoHzvCiz3hQZE4vLnN95xIknivwxH-AHuSoEkDjkMbvk0T-8IP-GMPmiI2e2VCMIDVQktL9S-fhs_-UB61kw_N=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></h2><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-align: left;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><span style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjxzbZb1W-DO-QYrnmgNUaH0qaYJNstl7CIzXQdVPfNswPPnSjp_njapuSxu-6CSMeflnXruWg0Ub47OMKmwRK1RbAKWdGS98ZjLKp1IfRkDFQ_7LohzzltkEH3vhAB_r2nB-iIOZ9rA-DlrAn8mM4VvedenWZedMWc81xyyHR_3KOYHl_0Q9CJYn5O4X80\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"\" data-original-height=\"1518\" data-original-width=\"1075\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjxzbZb1W-DO-QYrnmgNUaH0qaYJNstl7CIzXQdVPfNswPPnSjp_njapuSxu-6CSMeflnXruWg0Ub47OMKmwRK1RbAKWdGS98ZjLKp1IfRkDFQ_7LohzzltkEH3vhAB_r2nB-iIOZ9rA-DlrAn8mM4VvedenWZedMWc81xyyHR_3KOYHl_0Q9CJYn5O4X80=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEj1lnOTICPyoxViMDiaDQF2b8dTyR4_w5mg5Ts9U-boMxHVOUibMx5BbFGfnoHbaAnD8qNblbndoxf7JLCrsvLayDhKhc2n8yWRwOwkH0tkJmdMz1pGI7SCVmR8QmaB_gsKZ71yZ2T-Wb6YLIsKDiOI-pXGUnmir2FmT_pc1psl28BaljgJ6xPbSSix4ZnY\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEj1lnOTICPyoxViMDiaDQF2b8dTyR4_w5mg5Ts9U-boMxHVOUibMx5BbFGfnoHbaAnD8qNblbndoxf7JLCrsvLayDhKhc2n8yWRwOwkH0tkJmdMz1pGI7SCVmR8QmaB_gsKZ71yZ2T-Wb6YLIsKDiOI-pXGUnmir2FmT_pc1psl28BaljgJ6xPbSSix4ZnY=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div></div><br /><br /></div></div></span></div></div></div></span></h2><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Tsit个百年公園逐工lóng tsiok鬧熱--ê，有ê跳舞，有ê練氣功，做健康操、拍羽毛球、散步、行路--ê lóng有。秀娟逐早起lóng穿運動衫、運動鞋，踏輕鬆ê跤步來公園先se̍h兩大輾，ná行ná期待hit个人出現，kah伊同齊行一塊仔路mā好。</span></div></span><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>若無tn̄g--著，8點緊過來大欉榕仔跤，hit个人tī hia leh等--伊--ah，兩人互相使目尾，kah一陣人做伙做健康操。半點鐘結束了後，有ê人四散--去，in就揣一liâu雙人椅坐--落-來，規身重汗，互相kā對方ê汗拭拭--leh。Tsìn-sàng kā準備--來ê兩杯咖啡khe̍h--出-來，一人一杯恬恬仔lim，樹影跤風微微吹--來，聽--著--ê是鳥仔古錐ê歌聲、蟲thuā ê合奏聲，看--著--ê是青kìnn-kìnn ê草埔，hōo人神清氣mā爽，tsit个時tsūn鼻--著ê汗酸味mā是芳--ê。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>Tsit種逐工lóng期待見面ê日子已經有兩三個月--ah，Tsìn-sàng講：「Lán退休--ah，ē-tàng做陣去遊山玩水、出國旅行，tī阮厝後果子宅仔hia泡茶，lim咖啡，鼻花芳。過去kah阮某就是án-ne過日，無疑誤阮ê緣盡--ah，伊先走三年--ah，我tsiok懷念hit段日子。Tsit-má tn̄g著你，我看你是有tsit个福份，人生70 tsiah開始，進前ê代誌好bái lóng hōo過--去---ah，lán做伙享受70歲以後ê人生好--無？」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">秀娟22歲hit年，媒人紹介熟sāi福來，hit時tsūn就知影福來in兜散赤，m̄-koh伊人古意、拍拚。In爸母lóng過身--ah，兄哥娶某，大姊mā嫁翁--ah，賰伊孤單一个蹛tī破厝仔。秀娟ê阿母看福來tsiok有伊ê緣，對福來tsiânn有信心講：「無要緊，願拍拚免驚無新厝thang蹛，我單單一个查某囝niâ，囝婿就是半子，我ē-tàng kā lín tàu-sann-kāng。」秀娟ê終身大事就交hōo爸母做主--ah。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>結婚四年生一个查埔、一个查某，日子mā算平安快樂。Hit年一个風颱kā in ê破厝仔吹kah害了了，規間厝漏hòo-hòo，翁某參詳了後beh hak厝。當初阿母有十萬箍hōo秀娟做嫁妝，tsit幾年翁趁某khînn鬥鬥--leh大約儉20萬，阿母koh khe̍h出20萬hōo in sio添，tsiah有法度hak一間厝。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>命運ê轉變就tī in查某囝讀大學ê時，查某囝發生嚴重ê車禍，昏迷一禮拜後tsiah精神，命總算khioh--tńg-來--ah。Tsit段tī加護病房等待查某囝醒--來ê時間，對爸母是一種折磨，bē食bē睏操心peh腹。秀娟自hit-tsūn辭工廠ê khang-khuè，專心照顧查某囝，經過兩、三年ê復健，tsit-má鬥一肢假跤，有tang時坐輪椅，有法度家己生活--ah。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>慈母護囝、疼囝，逐不時ē去廟寺求神拜佛。Mā tī tsit段時間秀娟個性變kah愈來愈tsa̍t-mo̍oh，做代誌tsiânn龜毛。Beh去拜拜進前，ài先洗身軀，身軀洗好，浴間洗好用布lu仔拭拭--leh，koh用電風吹kah ta，án-ne伊tsiah行ē出門。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>Koh-khah hàm--ê是福來若想beh kah伊相好，伊就規身軀bē自在，koh ē起雞母皮，suà--落講：「我身體無爽快，另工好--無？」一擺koh一擺，福來tsiok失望，秀娟竟然kā伊講：「我真正無法度，你若有需要去外面買。」福來：「你叫我去khai查某？」秀娟表情tsiok無辜tìm一下仔頭。福來看伊án-ne，mā無想beh勉強--伊。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>翁仔某愈來愈冷淡，koh隔一站仔連話to無想beh講。逐禮拜ê生活費用福來就囥tī食飯桌仔，若有需要khah大ê開銷，秀娟就寫字條囥tī囥錢ê所在。有一工福來收--著ê字條寫：「冰箱ài換--ah！」伊行到秀娟ê房間口khà三聲，秀娟房門一下開，福來講：「灶跤hit台冰箱，明仔載我ē去換一台新--ê，啊你心內hit台冰箱tang時ē-tàng tàn-hìnn-sak，你m̄驚冰久ē變質--ooh？」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>福來面tài笑容，雙手beh攬秀娟。秀娟驚一tiô，退幾若步，福來mā是有血有目屎ê正常查埔人，哪ē堪得伊án-ne逃避。人攬無著，一腹肚氣無tè tháu，拳頭拇大大下kā梳妝台ê鏡bok--lueh，「khing」--一-聲，鏡破--去，手割kah流血流滴。秀娟趕緊khe̍h藥箱beh kā福來抹藥仔，福來手tshi̍h傷口止血，大聲huah：「你免leh假好衰--lah！Bē死--lah！一點仔傷哪有啥，我心ê疼tsiah是疼。」自hit擺挵破鏡了後，伊知影破鏡難重圓--ah，福來mā死心--ah。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>福來bē kiáu、bē嫖、bē lim酒，tī一間食品工廠上班；秀娟tī查某囝生活ē-hiáu自理了後，mā koh tńg去成衣工廠上班。食頭路人勤儉，beh講偌好額是無--lah，ē得過就好，到kah 60歲兩个lóng退休--ah，後生文隆mā娶某--ah，搬出去外面蹛，厝內賰翁仔某kah查某囝雅玲，一家三个看--起-來平平靜靜。福來tsit幾年受著冷淡ê對待，mā慣勢--ah，退休後ê興趣就是kah朋友去釣魚，kah秀娟各人過各人ê生活，tsit个年歲mā無青春少年時ê熱情--ah，恬恬仔過in掛名夫妻ê生活。無所求，就無怨無恨。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>Hit工Tsìn-sàng tī公園對秀娟講ê話，秀娟有囥tī心內。逐擺kah Tsìn-sàng見面後，頭殼內lóng是伊ê形影、伊ê聲音se̍h來se̍h去，m̄管是政治、時勢、生活、養生ê話題，秀娟lóng聽kah耳仔phak-phak-phak。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>因為秀娟ê龜毛個性kah對性ê冷感，hōo翁婿中年就失去恩愛ê翁仔某該有ê溫暖kah安慰。想起〈冰點〉tsit首歌ê歌詞：「冰人冰心免用冰，冰kah極點最不幸，啊……可怕--啊人生，tse kám是命中所註定？」想著對翁婿ê虧欠，目屎沓沓仔流--落-來。秀娟心tsiok亂，thài ē食老tsiah出癖，bái新婦緊慢lóng是ài見ta-ke-kuann，m̄知beh按怎對福來開喙。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>Hit工雅玲無tī厝內，秀娟面色tsiok沉重kā福來講：「Lán離婚好--無？」福來無感覺意外，sīm--一-下tsiah開喙：「你是食m̄-tio̍h藥仔？Iah是外口有查埔人，自早就ài離--ah，你到tsit-má tsiah提起，kàn lín娘！72歲tsiah beh離婚，笑破人ê喙！」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>秀娟拄開始驚福來bē接受，ē kā伊刁難，想bē到福來sáng勢講早就ài離--ah。秀娟講：「福來歹勢--lah！是有khah慢，你身體勇健beh食到100歲mā無問題，後面iáu有tsiok長ê路beh行，以後lán各人行各人ê路，mā感謝你一路行--來對我ê吞忍。離婚了後你m̄免搬厝，仝款蹛tī tsia，你頓一个印仔，我心就得著tháu放--ah，mài歹戲拖棚，對你對我lóng khah好。」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>隔--幾-工-仔tī雅玲ê見證之下兩人正式離婚。結婚50年，人leh慶祝金婚，福來kah秀娟ê人生mā是一个新ê開始，mā值得祝福。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>Tsit工仝款tī公園，仝款leh lim咖啡，秀娟kā Tsìn-sàng講：「70歲以後ê人生我知影beh按怎過，唱歌、運動、遊山玩水我ē-tàng陪伴--你，lán就是好朋友。你beh我做lín兜ê女主人我無愛，m̄-thang食老tsiah出癖，mài kā代誌舞kah siunn複雜，至少序細ē尊重--lán。」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>話講了，感覺心情無hiah-nī仔沉重--ah，tsit款ê感情債早就ài斷--ah。人生70歲tsiah開始，未來beh過自由自在、無掛慮無虧欠ê日子。</span></div></div><div><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhP8BqQtewRqP_TMEiC7BVYzbVV20dPeRvO4KOPGhxz0JmHFAFggjy3k9qchVzLj53VqpExWL_A2-m-3_0ZQio6dW6-7YzVD7kuZ1b3YueOouv8IJut5QjgYBEMQlk82gaiHRsB3A_ekYkq22NuzUfE9xX8h2ExK4F58_cNu3WBf92fjMCfZpsSk1L_Puff\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"\" data-original-height=\"3035\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"480\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhP8BqQtewRqP_TMEiC7BVYzbVV20dPeRvO4KOPGhxz0JmHFAFggjy3k9qchVzLj53VqpExWL_A2-m-3_0ZQio6dW6-7YzVD7kuZ1b3YueOouv8IJut5QjgYBEMQlk82gaiHRsB3A_ekYkq22NuzUfE9xX8h2ExK4F58_cNu3WBf92fjMCfZpsSk1L_Puff\" width=\"340\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear: both; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 q66pz984 b1v8xokw\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8Abong%E5%A0%B1?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZWDjUJsSxaPbx9rBf3emvc0qX31sZFFUgNNqOtI9vv64OwqXsGEcwI3lw-EjolqeunKDULXB2AzmrXPdDewdlrZi72lKhnFv6ZPAhhxYvK8KMzXeD-ekv7Y_z6BLYVkK4MlRank2JL7XQR1R13adh_SDiIvZcpr6jdEpFHPKpL2oc7EsEvYcOny0uZTPG13xlE&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" role=\"link\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; background-color: transparent; border-color: initial; border-style: initial; border-width: 0px; box